  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness. Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both share a short cooldown.": "Tidy Habitat suscite le bonheur. Enrichment Time attribue des billets. Les deux partagent un court temps de recharge.",
  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness. Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both use the same short care cooldown.": "Tidy Habitat suscite le bonheur. Enrichment Time attribue des billets. Les deux utilisent le même temps de recharge court pour les soins.",
