  "Toggle sound": "Activer/désactiver le son",
  "Tomato": "Tomate",
  "Too high! Merge quickly or aim away from the red line.": "Trop haut ! Fusionnez rapidement ou visez loin de la ligne rouge.",
  "Too slow: oxygen -12.": "Trop lent : oxygène -12.",
  "Tools change places": "Les outils changent de place",
